    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "real root, and there are only ﬁnitely many isomorphism classes of such V . This proves ﬁniteness of the number of G d-orbits in R dﬂag(Q). Corollary 3.4. For d ∈ NQ0, the representation space Rd(Q) is spherical if and only if there is no gentle imaginary root e ≤ d for Qd."
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "pdfua_tag" : "P",
    "id" : 3,
    "page number" : 1,
    "bounding box" : [ 126.72, 572.076, 485.408, 610.592 ],
    "font" : "CMR10",
    "font size" : 9.963,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "Proof. Sphericity of Rd(Q) is equivalent to Bd acting with ﬁnitely many orbits on Rd by Theorem 2.3. This is equivalent to G d acting with ﬁnitely many orbits on R dﬂag(Qd), and the previous proposition shows the claim."
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "pdfua_tag" : "P",
    "id" : 4,
    "level" : "1",
    "page number" : 1,
    "bounding box" : [ 263.52, 553.469, 348.347, 563.432 ],
    "font" : "CMCSC10",
    "font size" : 9.963,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "4. Classification"
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "pdfua_tag" : "P",
    "id" : 5,
    "page number" : 1,
    "bounding box" : [ 126.719, 523.589, 485.392, 545.432 ],
    "font" : "CMR10",
    "font size" : 9.963,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "To approach the classiﬁcation of spherical representation varieties, we ﬁrst show that we can restrict to excluding minimal non-spherical situations."
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "pdfua_tag" : "P",
    "id" : 6,
    "page number" : 1,
    "bounding box" : [ 126.719, 476.189, 485.087, 515.792 ],
    "font" : "CMTI10",
    "font size" : 9.963,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "Lemma 4.1. If d ≤ e are dimension vectors for Q and Rd(Q) is not spherical, then Re(Q) is not spherical. Proof. We have an embedding of quivers"
  }, {
    "type" : "paragraph",
    "pdfua_tag" : "P",
    "id" : 7,
    "page number" : 1,
    "bounding box" : [ 126.719, 427.457, 403.043, 470.072 ],
    "font" : "CMR10",
    "font size" : 9.963,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "ι : Qd → Qe, (i,k)  → (i,k + ei − di) for i ∈ Q0 and k ≤ di. It induces an embedding of Weyl groups ι : WQ"
